    <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>Judd, Ryan T., Hilary C. McCrary, Janice L. Farlow, Michael Li, Jeremy Godsell, Peter J. Kneuertz, und Enver Ozer. „Pedicled Osteomyocutaneous Pectoralis Major Flap with Osseous Rib Harvest for Salvage Mandibular Reconstruction: Case and Technique“. Head &amp; Neck 46, Nr. 2 (Februar 2024): 447–51. https://doi.org/10.1002/hed.27586.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
    <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>Patel, Ketan, Diana Jee-Hyun Lyu, und Deepak Kademani. „Pectoralis Major Myocutaneous Flap“. Oral and Maxillofacial Surgery Clinics of North America 26, Nr. 3 (August 2014): 421–26. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.coms.2014.05.010.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
