    <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>Bubberman, Jeske M., Joep A. F. Van Rooij, René R. W. J. Van der Hulst, und Stefania M. H. Tuinder. „Sensory Recovery and the Role of Innervated Flaps in Autologous Breast Reconstruction—a Narrative Review“. Gland Surgery 12, Nr. 8 (11. August 2023): 1094. https://doi.org/10.21037/gs-23-40.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
