    <dcterms:bibliographicCitation>Lee, Kyeong-Tae, und Goo-Hyun Mun. „Benefits of Superdrainage Using SIEV in DIEP Flap Breast Reconstruction: A Systematic Review and Meta-Analysis“. Microsurgery 37, Nr. 1 (Januar 2017): 75–83. https://doi.org/10.1002/micr.22420.</dcterms:bibliographicCitation>
